to bamboozle and trick people.

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:43.720
Trump used populist rhetoric in 2016.

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:52.110
Trump tricked many on the right and some on
the left with his populist rhetoric in 2016.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:57.160
And we are now seeing the repercussions of
that in the current administration.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:03.610
So I have an example for you today from Tucker
Carlson, which is exactly what I was warning

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:04.610
