been increasingly using the language of populism,

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:22.220
which sometimes sounds reasonable to hide
his horrible policy ideas.

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.690
Sometimes, Tucker, you turn it on.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:27.800
