00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.940
gushing about.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:51.880
Look at the common sense that we're hearing
here from Tucker Carlson.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.310
And it's painful to see people fall for it.

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:56.990
I warned you about this in my segment recently.

