00:02:11.939 --> 00:02:15.099
And yet both parties have shamelessly abandoned
them.

00:02:15.099 --> 00:02:17.400
Families have no national spokesman.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.840
They have no lobby in Washington.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:23.790
