health care for everybody?

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:39.970
Finance, education.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:41.940
How do we tax people well.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.260
How do we do policing?

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:50.310
There's so much policy and social democracy
