00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:55.990
It can come from the left than right and it
can sound pretty damn good with no regard

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:58.620
to the policies that are actually being proposed.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:04.200
So to be clear, you can have populist rhetoric
